      "scale": "0 unusable, 5 functional with substantial friction, 7 good with noticeable friction, 10 exceptional with negligible observed friction. Subjective holistic ratings of these two emulated sessions; wins alone are not grades. Overall is not an arithmetic average.",
      "overallMobile": 7,
      "controls": 6.5,
      "gameplay": 7,
      "presentation": 8,
      "usability": 7.5,
      "readability": 6.5,
      "reasons": {
        "overallMobile": "Coherent atmospheric mission with useful assistance and clear progression; target acquisition failures and dense small-screen information temper the rating.",
        "controls": "Two-contact movement/fire drag and scene turn worked in sampled engagements, but two COVER bursts required correction. Much navigation and aiming was assisted; continuous hold comfort unassessed.",
        "gameplay": "Observed recovery, patrols, three-coil timing phase and uplink defense supplied understandable variety. Assistance supported progress but limits conclusions about manual traversal, challenge and sustained enjoyment.",
        "presentation": "Rain, reflective ground, cyan/amber palette and industrial silhouettes gave a cohesive atmosphere; end-screen typography was clear. Audio not assessed.",
        "usability": "Route/approach holds, progress banners, large map destination buttons and explicit fresh restart were helpful. Context changes add learning overhead.",
        "readability": "Objective, ammo and end stats were readable, but tiny enemies, small map legend and competing translucent HUD panels made scanning harder."
      }
    },
